  "about": "The instances the Compendium places things in, by their map (the client's Map ID). Read by pipelines/quests/tools/export_compendium.py and pipelines/books/tools/places.mjs, which file a dungeon's quests and writings under the zone of its entrance, and by pipelines/lib/dungeons.mjs, which writes addons/Spoken/Data/Dungeons.lua with the names in every language from the client's Map table. `zone` is the uiMapID of the zone the entrance is in. `story` is the Zones area whose story is the dungeon's card on the Zones tab ([uiMapID, key] in Spoken_Places' Subzones.lua), absent where no area tells it. `worldBosses` are the maps of the world bosses (Kazzak, Azuregos, Thaunderaan, the Emerald Dragons): the Bosses tab lists their bosses straight under the zone, with no card for the map. `instances` are instance maps that are no dungeon, filed as the zone of their entrance (the PvP halls; the Excavation Site is an instance of the Wetlands' own story), and `battlegrounds` each battleground's map with its zone map.",
